: 152px) 100vw, 152px\" title=\"Daniel Alvarez\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 152px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 152\/153;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\">Daniel Alvarez<\/h3><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663883ba09a34-3-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell panel-grid-cell-empty\" ><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1531-2\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-1531-2-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1531-2-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"4\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743-1531\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tdata-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/San-Francisco-2-1.jpg\" width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/San-Francisco-2-1.jpg 1254w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/San-Francisco-2-1-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/San-Francisco-2-1-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/San-Francisco-2-1-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/San-Francisco-2-1-768x768.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1254px) 100vw, 1254px\" title=\"San Francisco 2\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1254px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1254\/1254;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1531-2-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"5\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-1531-2-0-1\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><h3><b>Understanding Workers\u2019 Compensation in San Francisco<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">San Francisco is a unique city with diverse industries and a workforce that includes tech professionals, restaurant staff, construction workers, and healthcare providers. At Franco Mu\u00f1oz, we\u2019ve seen it all and are here to help you navigate the complexities of filing a workers\u2019 compensation claim in San Francisco.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s what you need to do if you\u2019re injured at work:<\/span><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Report Your Injury Immediately<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Inform your employer about your workplace injury as soon as possible. This is the first step in protecting your rights.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Get Medical Attention<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Seek prompt medical care. San Francisco has a wide range of top-tier healthcare facilities, and we can help you find a provider that specializes in work-related injuries.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>File Your Claim<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: We will assist you with completing the necessary paperwork, including the DWC-1 form, to officially file your claim.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Case Investigation<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: We gather evidence and medical reports to build a strong case for maximum benefits.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Receive Your Benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: If your claim is approved, you\u2019ll receive compensation for medical expenses, lost wages, and any permanent disability.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1531-3\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div id=\"home-it-works\" class=\"panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-1531-3\" ><div id=\"pgc-1531-3-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1531-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_siteorigin-panels-builder panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"6\" ><div id=\"pl-w663f227744a5d\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-w663f227744a5d-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-w663f227744a5d-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f227744a5d-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"0\" ><div class=\"heading panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-w663f227744a5d-0-0-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HOW IT WORKS<\/h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law, California's premier workers\u2019 compensation attorneys, simplify the process like 1-2-3.<\/h4>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-w663f227744a5d-1\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-w663f227744a5d-1-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f227744a5d-1-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"1\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p><script src=\"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/embed\/medias\/gadw8m3bgo.jsonp\" async><\/script><script src=\"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/assets\/external\/E-v1.js\" async><\/script><\/p>\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_padding\" style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\">\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_wrapper\" style=\"height:100%;left