t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663f227744a80-2-2\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f227744a80-2-2-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-icon panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"10\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-icon so-widget-sow-icon-default-53356942a464\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-icon-container sow-icon\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"sow-icon-fontawesome sow-fas\" data-sow-icon=\"&#xf4ce;\"\n\t\t \n\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\t<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663f227744a80-2-3\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f227744a80-2-3-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"11\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2>Keep Our Services Without Paying Anything Upfront.<\/h2>\n<p>After our lawyers thoroughly review your case, our office will act as your dedicated point of contact, ensuring your case achieves the best possible outcome.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-w663f227744a80-3\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-w663f227744a80-3-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f227744a80-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"12\" ><div class=\"numbers-increment panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-w663f227744a80-3-0-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h5>4<\/h5>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663f227744a80-3-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f227744a80-3-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"13\" ><div class=\"item-point no-line panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-w663f227744a80-3-1-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663f227744a80-3-2\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f227744a80-3-2-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-icon panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"14\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-icon so-widget-sow-icon-default-ae9a661b2197\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-icon-container sow-icon\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"sow-icon-fontawesome sow-fas\" data-sow-icon=\"&#xf4b9;\"\n\t\t \n\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\t<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663f227744a80-3-3\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f227744a80-3-3-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"15\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2>Start Receiving Eligible Medical and Monetary Benefits.<\/h2>\n<p>We'll fight for your medical treatment, lost wages, and compensation.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1531-4\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-1531-4-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1531-4-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"7\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-1531-4-0-0\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><h3><b>Types of Workers\u2019 Compensation Benefits for San Francisco Workers<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">California law provides a range of workers\u2019 compensation benefits designed to help you recover and get back to work. These include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Medical Treatment<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Full coverage for necessary medical care, including hospital visits, surgeries, physical therapy, and medication.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Temporary Disability Benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Compensation for lost wages if your injury prevents you from working temporarily.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Permanent Disability Benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Payments if your injury leads to lasting impairments that affect your ability to work.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Supplemental Job Displacement Benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Vouchers for retraining or skill enhancement if you can\u2019t return to your previous job.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Death Benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Financial support for the dependents of a worker who has died due to a work-related injury or illness.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Common Workplace Injuries in San Francisco<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">San Francisco\u2019s economy is powered by diverse industries, each with its own risks. We have extensive experience handling claims for injuries such as:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Tech-Related Repetitive Strain Injuries<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Common among office workers and programmers who spend long hours at computers.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Construction Accidents<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Including falls from scaffolding, equipment malfunctions, and exposure to hazardous materials on job sites.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Restaurant and Hospitality Injuries<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Slip-and-fall accidents, burns, and cuts are frequent in the city\u2019s vibrant restaurant scene.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Healthcare Worker Injuries<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Including back strains from patient handling and exposure to infectious diseases.<\/span><\/li>\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Transportation and Delivery Accidents<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Injuries from vehicle accidents are common among gig workers and delivery drivers navigating the busy city streets.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1531-4-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"8\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743-1531\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tdata-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/San-Francisco-tech-workers-768x768.png\" width=\"720\" height=\"720\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/San-Francisco-tech-workers-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/San-Francisco-tech-workers-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/San-Francisco-tech-workers-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/San-Francisco-tech-workers.png 1024w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" title=\"San Francisco tech workers\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 720px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 720\/720;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1531-4-0-2\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymc